{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Immutable basis\n`2697be85ccc223c245815bc6ad818ebee2915c70`: 18 Python modules, 124 editable blocks (77 docstrings, 47 full-line comment regions), and 14,024 parent words (`\\\\b[\\\\w][\\\\w’'-]*\\\\b`). All stable IDs from `d6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84` still resolve; intervening mainline prose is outside this leaf. The generated reference is path 19.\n\n## Boundary and stable allowlist\nOnly listed Python blocks and adjacent blanks may change. `D:<owner>` identifies a docstring; `C:<scope>:before:<anchor>` a full-line region; `:occN` disambiguates repeats. `docs/mcp-reference.md` changes only via its generator and needs no receipt row. Full ID: `<path>#<ID>`.\n- `__init__.py` — `D:<module>; C:<module>:before:{import:rebar._config_coercion,import:rebar._errors,import:rebar._lib_writes,import:_store.push_state,logging.getLogger}`; exports, compatibility, push-state visibility, NullHandler.\n- `_alias.py` — `D:{<module>,_wordlist_path,_load,compute_genesis_alias}`; deterministic formats/persistence, fallback, warn-once.\n- `_child_env.py` — `D:{<module>,project_child_env}; C:<module>:before:_ADAPTER_SECRET_NAMES`; secret-name registry and three environment projections.\n- `_config_resolvers.py` — `D:{<module>,resolve_fetch_timeout,repo_root_or_none,resolve_otlp_endpoint,resolve_detected_by,resolve_os_actor,snapshot_repo_root}; C:<module>:before:{_positive_int,repo_root_or_none,_gate_str_pref}`; resolver ownership, live reads, timeout/repo-root selection.\n- `_config_schema.py` — `C:CompactConfig:before:trigger; C:ReconcilerConfig:before:{dc_pandoc_timeout_s,max_acting_fraction,base_url}`; mirror omission, pandoc fallback, circuit breaker, always-on bas