lm_tools.sign_review}; C:_start_gate_job:before:if:handle-is_new; C:_register_gate_start_tools.review_plan_start:before:import:anyio.to_thread; C:register_llm_tools.verify_completion:before:ro; C:register_llm_tools.review_plan:before:ro`; tool shapes, polling/read failures, signer-context daemon.\n- `_mcp_models.py` — `D:{<module>,_OmitUnsetOut,PushStatusOut,WriteAckOut,FsckOut}; C:TicketStateOut:before:{cross_session_warning,author,created_at}; C:WriteAckOut:before:{description_warning,cross_session_warning}; C:CreateResultOut:before:duplicate_warning; C:GateResultOut:before:verdict: str; C:SignResultOut:before:ticket_id: str; C:VerifySignatureResultOut:before:trust_basis; C:PlanReviewStatusOut:before:ok: bool; C:VerifyCompletionStatusOut:before:ok: bool; C:GateRunOut:before:job_id: str; C:WorkflowRunOut:before:run_id: str; C:<module>:before:except:ImportError`; null/absence, JS safety, delivery/fsck fields, tool annotations.\n- `_mcp_opcert_health.py` — `D:{<module>,opcert_signing_status,run_startup_opcert_check}`; pinned-key comparison, serve-degraded posture.\n- `_mcp_reads.py` — `D:{<module>,_register_plan_review_tools.plan_review_status,_register_plan_review_tools.verify_completion_status,_register_plan_review_tools.gate_status,_register_bridge_projects_read,_register_bridge_projects_read.bridge_projects_list,_discovery_rows,register_read_tools.explain_criterion,register_read_tools.list_tickets,register_read_tools.audit_trail,register_read_tools.ready_tickets,register_read_tools.search,register_read_tools.verify_signature}`; status vocabularies, bounded lean/full contracts, guides/errors.\n\n## Protected material / consumers\nExcluded as concise/policy-load-bearing (15 blocks): `_mcp_budget.py#C:<module>:before:_DEFAULT_LIST_REMEDY`; `_mcp_health.py#C:offload_sync_tools:before:if:is_async`; `_mcp_inflight.py#D:{reset_registry,seed_stale_entry,_sweep_locked}`; `_mcp_models.py#C:TicketStateOut:before:inbound_deps; C:CreateResultOut:before:description_warning; C: