on-author PASS rows exist.\n\n## Verification\nRun seven local DD rows: immutable-prose-only, exact-leaf-paths, generated-mcp-reference, focused-tests, scoped-ruff, comment-hygiene, and diff-integrity. Gerrit `Verified` supplies repository-gates."}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1789056348611730001,"uuid":"4f32675c-fac9-487c-af86-f09feb1b2791"}